      <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S3</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"97928\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_PG.png\" alt=\"BBFC PG\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/97928/zootropolis-2/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/zoo2_payoff_1sht_awat50pc_1_bb673603.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/zoo2_payoff_1sht_awat50pc_1_bb673603.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n        <img class=\"film-poster\" src=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/zoo2_payoff_1sht_awat50pc_1_bb673603.jpg\">\n    </picture>\n\n</div>\n\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tile-details\">\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/97928/zootropolis-2/\">\n                                        <div class=\"tile-name\">\n                                            <h1 class=\"ellipse\">Zootropolis 2</h1></div>\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"tile-subname clamp\">Detectives Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootopia and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that the film contains several sequences with flashing lights that may affect those who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or have other photo sensitivities.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"197\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-15T13:30:00\" href=\"/bookings/197/\">\n    13:30\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S2</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"198\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-15T16:10:00\" href=\"/bookings/198/\">\n    16:10\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S2</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"95774\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_PG.png\" alt=\"BBFC PG\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/95774/wicked-for-good/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/wicked-for-good-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/wicked-for-good-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n        <img class=\"film-poster\" src=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/wicked-for-good-poster.jpg\">\n    </picture>\n\n</div>\n\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tile-details\">\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/95774/wicked-for-good/\">\n                                        <div class=\"tile-name\">\n                                            <h1 class=\"ellipse\">Wicked: For Good</h1></div>\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"tile-subname clamp\">Elphaba (Cynthia Erivo), now demonized as The Wicked Witch of the West, lives in exile, hidden within the Ozian forest while continuing her fight for the freedom of Oz's silenced Animals and desperately trying to expose the truth she knows about The Wizard (Jeff Goldblum). \r\n\r\nGlinda, meanwhile, has become the glamorous symbol of Goodness for all of Oz, living at the palace in Emerald City and reveling in the perks of fame and popularity.\r\n\r\nAs an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, Glinda and Elphaba will need to come together one final time. With their singular friendship now the fulcrum of their futures, they will need to truly see each other, with honesty and empathy, if they are to change themselves, and all of Oz, for good.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"200\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-15T13:40:00\" href=\"/bookings/200/\">\n    13:40\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S3</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"195\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-15T16:00:00\" href=\"/bookings/195/\">\n    16:00\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S1</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"9001\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_U.png\" alt=\"BBFC U\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/9001/the-muppet-christmas-carol/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/muppet-christmas-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/muppet-christmas-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n        <img class=\"film-poster\" src=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/muppet-christmas-poster.jpg\">\n    </picture>\n\n</div>\n\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tile-details\">\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/9001/the-muppet-christmas-carol/\">\n                                        <div class=\"tile-name\">\n                                            <h1 class=\"ellipse\">The Muppet Christmas Carol</h1></div>\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"tile-subname clamp\">The Muppets put their heartfelt, hilarious spin on Charles Dickens’ classic festive tale. \r\n\r\nMichael Caine stars as the miserly Ebenezer Scrooge, whose icy heart is confronted by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Yet to Come. With Kermit the Frog as Bob Cratchit, Miss Piggy as Emily Cratchit, and the whole Muppet ensemble bringing warmth, music and mischief, this cherished adaptation blends witty humour with genuine emotional depth.\r\n\r\nA joyful, family favourite that celebrates kindness, redemption, and the true spirit of Christmas.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"201\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-15T16:45:00\" href=\"/bookings/201/\">\n    16:45\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S3</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"2575\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_15.png\" alt=\"BBFC 15\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/2575/love-actually/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/love-actually-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/love-actually-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n        <img class=\"film-poster\" src=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/love-actually-poster.jpg\">\n    </picture>\n\n</div>\n\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tile-details\">\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/2575/love-actually/\">\n                                        <div class=\"tile-name\">\n                                            <h1 class=\"ellipse\">Love Actually</h1></div>\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"tile-subname clamp\">Richard Curtis merges comedy and drama in this wonderful, feel-good treat featuring a stellar cast including Alan Rickman, Emma Thompson, Hugh Grant, Liam Neeson, Bill Nighy, and Colin Firth. Hilarious, sweet and hopelessly romantic.\r\n\r\nLove Actually follows the lives of eight very different couples in dealing with their love lives in various loosely interrelated tales all set during a frantic month before Christmas in London.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"199\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-15T18:45:00\" href=\"/bookings/199/\">\n    18:45\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S2</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"96464\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_15.png\" alt=\"BBFC 15\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/96464/bugonia/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/bugoniaposter.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/bugoniaposter.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n        <img class=\"film-poster\" src=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/bugoniaposter.jpg\">\n    </picture>\n\n</div>\n\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tile-details\">\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/96464/bugonia/\">\n                                        <div class=\"tile-name\">\n                                            <h1 class=\"ellipse\">Bugonia</h1></div>\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"tile-subname clamp\">The latest mindbending masterpiece from Yorgos Lanthimos (The Favourite/The Lobster).\r\n\r\nTwo conspiracy-obsessed men (Jesse Plemons and Aidan Delbis) who kidnap a powerful CEO (Emma Stone), believing she is an alien sent to destroy Earth. The men, who are convinced the CEO is responsible for ecological disasters and other global problems, hold her captive and try to force her to reveal her alien origins.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"196\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-15T19:10:00\" href=\"/bookings/196/\">\n    19:10\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n            <span class=\"screening-type\">£6 Monday!</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S1</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    \n                        <h3 class=\"date\">Tue, 16 Dec</h3>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"104159\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_18.png\" alt=\"BBFC 18\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/104159/pillion/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/pillion-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/pillion-poster.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n        <img class=\"film-poster\" src=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/pillion-poster.jpg\">\n    </picture>\n\n</div>\n\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tile-details\">\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/104159/pillion/\">\n                                        <div class=\"tile-name\">\n                                            <h1 class=\"ellipse\">Pillion</h1></div>\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"tile-subname clamp\">Wallflower Colin (Harry Melling) leads a humdrum existence until he meets the impossibly handsome Ray (Alexander Skarsgård), a mysterious biker he is soon desperately devoted to. As Colin submits to Ray and enters an exciting new world of desire, he must decide the limits of his devotion.\r\n\r\nHilarious, subversive and sexy, Pillion is the acclaimed and surprisingly tender love story from writer director Harry Lighton, starring Melling and Skarsgård in fearless performances as a mild young man and his leather-clad lover.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"204\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-16T13:20:00\" href=\"/bookings/204/\">\n    13:20\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S1</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"211\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-16T19:00:00\" href=\"/bookings/211/\">\n    19:00\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S3</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"97928\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/images/BBFC_PG.png\" alt=\"BBFC PG\">\n</div>\n\n\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/97928/zootropolis-2/\">\n                                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\" responsive-image-wrapper programme-image-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 150.0%;\">\n\n\n    \n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/zoo2_payoff_1sht_awat50pc_1_bb673603.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_webp,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <source srcset=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/zoo2_payoff_1sht_awat50pc_1_bb673603.jpg, /optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/images/default-poster.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n        <img class=\"film-poster\" src=\"/optimised-images/c_crop,ar_128:192/w_128,h_192,f_jpg,q_auto/https://thecastlecinema.com/_media/zoo2_payoff_1sht_awat50pc_1_bb673603.jpg\">\n    </picture>\n\n</div>\n\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tile-details\">\n                                    <a href=\"/programme/97928/zootropolis-2/\">\n                                        <div class=\"tile-name\">\n                                            <h1 class=\"ellipse\">Zootropolis 2</h1></div>\n                                    </a>\n                                    <div class=\"tile-subname clamp\">Detectives Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootopia and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that the film contains several sequences with flashing lights that may affect those who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or have other photo sensitivities.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"203\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-16T13:30:00\" href=\"/bookings/203/\">\n    13:30\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S2</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"207\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2025-12-16T16:10:00\" href=\"/bookings/207/\">\n    16:10\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S2</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"programme-tile tile slim\" data-prog-id=\"95774\" data-filters=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"slim-table\">\n                                <div class=\"tile-img\">\n                                    \n\n<div class=\"bbfc\">\n    <img src=\"/static/i